<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian weekly soybean and product shipment.</title>
<headline>Brazilian weekly soybean and product shipment.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGS do Brasil reported the following Brazilian soybean and products shipments in the week ended December 29 compared with the previous week and the corresponding week last year, in tonnes -</p>
<p>    Week ended   Week ended   Week ended</p>
<p>	    29/12/96     22/12/96     31/12/95</p>
<p> Bean	  nil	    nil	    nil</p>
<p> Meal	 50,500	100,700	101,200</p>
<p> Oil	  11,500	  nil	   10,500</p>
<p>The following are shipments so far in the 1996/97 February-January marketing year compared with the corresponding date in the previous year, in tonnes -</p>
<p>	    1996/97	 1995/96</p>
<p> Bean   3,577,600     3,762,000</p>
<p> Meal  10,235,000    10,878,000</p>
<p> Oil    1,265,100     1,658,100</p>
<p>Note - Shipment this marketing year includes 408,200 tonnes of Paraguayan origin. Previous marketing year includes 619,000 tonnes of Paraguayan origin.</p>
</text>
